Stage 1: Auto-Annotation (AI)
  pipeline_1a_annotation_of_images/
  - GPT-5.5 vision + EasyOCR analyzes HMI screenshots
  - Outputs structured JSON with bounding boxes for all UI elements
        |
        v
Stage 2: Human Review & Validation
  Annotation_tool/
  - Browser-based annotation tool (zero install)
  - Load the Stage 1 JSON + original images
  - Add missing elements, fix bounding boxes, validate labels
  - Export corrected annotation JSON
        |
        v
Stage 3: Final Merge
  json/
  - Merges human-reviewed annotations with navigation data (from PDF)
  - Produces the final ground-truth dataset
  annotation_and_navigation_merged_for_11pages_248images.json
